  "scientific_constraints": [
    "Detection instantiation: one P3/8 replacement, P3/P4/P5 neck inputs.",
    "Stage 4 output includes SPPF; downsampling is abstracted into stages.",
    "Other tasks are separately configured, not simultaneous detector heads.",
    "Local standard deviation takes corrected features, not the trend.",
    "Guidance I is a trained structural signal, not calibrated reliability.",
    "I conditions only input modulation and step-size generation.",
    "B,C originate from u before input modulation.",
    "Gamma and write gate multiply the same scan input.",
    "Trend energy is feature RMS, not physical scattering energy.",
    "The output bypass uses corrected x; output gating uses z.",
    "Core R and the full residual/FFN block are distinct panels."
  ],
